{"id":"n4-004","title":"A より B のほうが〜 (A yori B no hou ga 〜)","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Comparing two things; 'B is more ~ than A'.","longExplanation":"The より and のほうが grammar pattern is used to compare two things by means of an adjective or verb. In this structure, item A is compared to item B, suggesting that item B is more ~ than item A.","formation":"A + より + B + のほうが + Adjective/Verb","examples":[{"jp":"田中さんより鈴木さんのほうが背が高いです。","romaji":"Tanaka-san yori Suzuki-san no hou ga se ga takai desu.","en":"Suzuki is taller than Tanaka.","words":[{"surface":"田中","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"より","vocabId":null},{"surface":"鈴木","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ほう","vocabId":"1516930","reading":"ほう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"背","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"高い","vocabId":"1283190","reading":"たかい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,5,6,7]},{"jp":"リンゴよりバナナのほうが甘いです。","romaji":"Ringo yori banana no hou ga amai desu.","en":"Bananas are sweeter than apples.","words":[{"surface":"リンゴ","vocabId":"1555480","reading":"りんご"},{"surface":"より","vocabId":null},{"surface":"バナナ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ほう","vocabId":"1516930","reading":"ほう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"甘い","vocabId":"1213400","reading":"あまい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,3,4,5]},{"jp":"冬より夏のほうが暑いです。","romaji":"Fuyu yori natsu no hou ga atsui desu.","en":"Summer is hotter than winter.","words":[{"surface":"冬","vocabId":"1446070","reading":"ふゆ"},{"surface":"より","vocabId":null},{"surface":"夏","vocabId":"1191320","reading":"なつ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ほう","vocabId":"1516930","reading":"ほう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"暑い","vocabId":"1343460","reading":"あつい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,3,4,5]},{"jp":"東京より京都のほうが歴史があると思います。","romaji":"Toukyou yori Kyouto no hou ga rekishi ga aru to omoimasu.","en":"I think Kyoto has more history than Tokyo.","words":[{"surface":"東京","vocabId":"1447690","reading":"とうきょう"},{"surface":"より","vocabId":null},{"surface":"京都","vocabId":"1652350","reading":"きょうと"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ほう","vocabId":"1516930","reading":"ほう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歴史","vocabId":"1558050","reading":"れきし"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思い","vocabId":"1589320","reading":"おもい","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,3,4,5]}]}